title Cassette bound (studio input, 16 to 96 kHz, 16 and 24-bit): the Sample rate picker lists every rate with its size per minute and hours free; 96 kHz chosen, the row says so
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD rich
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CODECS both
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
key s
wait 500
expect text "48 kHz"
shot settings
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 500
expect text "96 kHz"
expect text "44.1 kHz"
expect text "12 MB/min"
expect text "Sizes for WAV, 16-bit, this card"
shot picker-top
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key enter
wait 800
expect text "96 kHz"
shot settings-96k
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
say the capture reopened at 96 kHz (the next take is written at it)
expect noquit
